{"content_html": "<div>\n<!-- BEGIN COMPONENT:: COMPONENT002494 -->\n<div>\n<figure><picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"HV L5N1XIAAbMNp.jpg\" src=\"https://static-images.vnncdn.net/vps_images_publish/000001/000003/2026/11/1/hv-l5n1xiaabmnp-4.jpg?width=0&amp;s=wG1Uy2nzosapZRID6WtCaQ\"/></picture>\n<figcaption>Sự xuất sắc của thủ thành Verbruggen giúp Brighton giữ sạch mành lưới - Ảnh: BHA</figcaption>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>Đội hình ra sân</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Man City (4-2-3-1):</strong> Donnarumma, Nunes, Khusanov, Dias, Gvardiol, Bouaddi, Anderson, Fernández, Ndiaye, Doku, Haaland.</p>\n<p><strong>Brighton (4-2-3-1): </strong>Verbruggen; Costinha, Vuskovic, Dunk, Boscagli; Gross, Chema; Gomez, Ayari, De Cuyper; Kostoulas.</p>\n<p><strong>Bàn thắng:</strong> Ayari 11'</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td>Kết quả</td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span>Vòng 9</span></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>31/10/2026 19:30:00</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://vietnamnet.vn\"> <picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.vnncdn.net/media.api-sports.io/football/teams/49.png?width=0&amp;s=GaQAJTiDsGe__Vfkm6W5ug\"/></picture>Chelsea </a> 2 - 0 <a href=\"https://vietnamnet.vn\"> <picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.vnncdn.net/media.api-sports.io/football/teams/33.png?width=0&amp;s=o20OtOW8JOnrAD_OhUNZOg\"/></picture> Manchester United </a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>31/10/2026 22:00:00</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://vietnamnet.vn\"> <picture><!--[if IE 9]><video style=\"display: none;\"><![endif]--><!--[if IE 9]></video><![endif]--><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.vnncdn.net/media.api-sports.io/football/teams/1346.png?width=0&amp;s=bfMhHXGjYyP5unBRvu_a2w\"/></picture>Coventry </a> 3 - 1 <a href=\"https://vietnamnet.vn\"